  - m_Id: 86146383499264
    m_Localized: Selecting host allows you to set the game configuration. Other players
      connected to the same network will be able to join your created room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86538651586560
    m_Localized: Once the host created a room, the other players will be able to
      join the same room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87174860394496
    m_Localized: The host can start the game if the number of players within the
      room is greater than 1 and not exceeding to 4
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90006917369856
    m_Localized: Select Mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93103832059904
    m_Localized: Waiting for<br>available host...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93982400335872
    m_Localized: Number of times answered the question correctly on first choice,
      streak will reset if one of you have incorrect answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94697583693824
    m_Localized: "+15 points for 0 mistakes; otherwise, 10 \u2212 team mistakes this
      round"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96459367534592
    m_Localized: Ratings is calculated by (1 - (player mistakes over 3*total rounds))
      * 100
