  - m_Id: 1005739230777344
    m_Localized: 'Greetings '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1005974615117824
    m_Localized: It appears your'e new to this game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1006705371926528
    m_Localized: Allow me to show you how the game works
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1007216091353088
    m_Localized: This huge Card contains the question that needs to be solved
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1008171629301760
    m_Localized: These 3 items are the choices you can pick from to solve the card
      question
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1009643267969024
    m_Localized: Try clicking the first choice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1010841907777536
    m_Localized: Uh-oh.. looks like that wasn't the correct answer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013518104416256
    m_Localized: Let's try the second one
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1014113431343104
    m_Localized: Look's like this wasn't the right one either
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1016866589265920
    m_Localized: Well we only have one option left...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1017408380096512
    m_Localized: Great! Looks like we found the meaning of the question
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1018625651003392
    m_Localized: Everytime you solve the question you will get +10 score
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1019362078511104
    m_Localized: Once you solve the question, a new one will appear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1020199936872448
    m_Localized: Looks like a free hint appeared out of nowhere... Tap the card to
      consume it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1021689812373504
    m_Localized: Consuming a hint will reveal the correct answer for a short period
      of time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1022264381689856
    m_Localized: Try selecting the answer that being displayed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1022989992087552
    m_Localized: Getting the answer right on your first try will increase your streak
      by 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1023834334842880
    m_Localized: Now try accumulating your streak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1024561413246976
    m_Localized: Therefore, evertime you accumulate 3 streak, you will get 1 hint,
      but making a single mistake will ruin your streak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1025751303737344
    m_Localized: Woah, we got 1 hint!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1026431804395520
    m_Localized: Now that you learned how to play it, You can try it yourself!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027196878999552
    m_Localized: Oh-no, I didn't realize the clock was running out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1029438319251456
    m_Localized: You can't have fun playing with that little amount time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1052029989834752
    m_Localized: I'll transfer you to the actual game and try out what you've learned!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1405120736022528
    m_Localized: You can earn +1 hint for every<br>3 consecutive streaks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1406472925106176
    m_Localized: Tap the Flash Card to use hint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1406924576149504
    m_Localized: One mistake will reset streak.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1407425409601536
    m_Localized: You can edit your profile by clicking<br>avatar in Main Menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1408899392884736
    m_Localized: Need help? Go to dictionary!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1409705491976192
    m_Localized: Save your hints for challenging<br>questions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1410175082057728
    m_Localized: Practice makes progress.<br>Keep playing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1411597580259328
    m_Localized: Every word you learn keeps<br>Kapampangan alive!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1412221248098304
    m_Localized: Build up your streak by getting answers<br>right on the first try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1434152265469952
    m_Localized: Keep your streak alive to earn<br>more hints.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1434867599822848
    m_Localized: Learn a new Kapampangan word<br>with every round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1435136995774464
    m_Localized: Discover Kapampangan words<br>while having fun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1435560381403136
    m_Localized: Have you tried playing with your friends?<br>Try Multiplayer Mode!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1436039710658560
    m_Localized: Pausing the game will not stop<br>the clock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1438769497919488
    m_Localized: Your team can earn +1 hint for<br>every 3 consecutive streaks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1440412897529856
    m_Localized: Work together and communicate<br>with your team.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1440742938923008
    m_Localized: Communication is the Key.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1441477739040768
    m_Localized: The correct answer may be in<br>another player's choices.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1442263151824896
    m_Localized: Your choices can help your team<br>find the correct answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1442785774686208
    m_Localized: Don't rush, discuss your choices<br>with your teammates.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1443968736186368
    m_Localized: Build up streak by getting answers<br>right on the first try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1444727733243904
    m_Localized: Keep your streak alive to earn<br>more hints.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1445651046354944
    m_Localized: Hints are shared, use them when<br>your team needs help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1447799595356160
    m_Localized: Play together - Learn together.<br>Speak Kapampangan!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1450338013302784
    m_Localized: Loading
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455857440542720
    m_Localized: 'Waiting for other<br>players '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1456908734451712
    m_Localized: All set!\nPress Start to begin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
